<TXSPN>There was no sign of <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> in the outside walkway.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\マンション入り口.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\鍵を置く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I put the key into the mailbox for <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s apartment.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It is a dial lock, so nobody outside the Niimura family can open it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\駐輪場.gal" "WAIT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s bicycle was still left in the bike parking.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If she forgot her smartphone, she probably did not have her bicycle key either.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
―I walked along the prefectural road for a while.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "My_life_Without_Your_Love.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\コンビニ昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
5 minutes later, I reached the convenience store nearest the apartment.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On the bench in front of the convenience store―
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> was sitting.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just as I had guessed. We have not been best friends all these years <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="だて">for nothing</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I stood beside <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> without a word.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Uh...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">I'm sorry..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I sat down on the bench as well and <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="のぞ">peered</STYLE> into <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s downturned face.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I should have realized back when I first thought </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was acting strangely. I'm sorry."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you're the one who shouldn't be apologizing... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Huh?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">　You're all right being outside?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, I seem to be doing fine today. And shutting myself up at home the whole time is even worse for my health."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"If that's so, I'm glad..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> finally showed a faint smile.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, since we're out here, let's take a bit of a walk. It's exactly at times like this that you have to get some outside air!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey now, is that any way for </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">an April sickness patient</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> to talk?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We laughed a little together.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"If you like, shall we go to Chuo Park, where </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> wanted to go?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"No, that's honestly too far on foot. Wandering around here is fine. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Oh! </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, the house key!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I locked up and put it in the mailbox."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Haah, then it's all right."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s face showed <STYLE ID="5" RUBY="あんど">relief</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
But,<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh! I forgot my phone!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, I noticed it was lying there, but I'd have hated for us to miss each other, so I left it behind."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Come to think of it, I had gone and forgotten my own smartphone too. All I had with me was my wallet.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭かく.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hmm, forget the phone, I don't have my wallet or my key either... I embarrassed myself trying to buy a drink just now..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Ahaha! Wait here a moment."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自動ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\店出入り.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
I said that and went into the convenience store.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I know what drink <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> likes.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\コンビニ昼.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Here!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\超炭酸.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "550" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I handed the Ultra Fizz Bomber into <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s hand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In a can as thick as an oxygen cylinder, an ultra,
{PAUSE ""}
ultra
{PAUSE ""}
ultra
{PAUSE ""}
ultra
{PAUSE ""}
intensely carbonated drink.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Everyone around rates it terribly, but <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> loves it and drinks it often.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She cannot take spicy food, and yet apparently she likes this sort of thing.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ooh! That's my </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">best friend</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> for you! Thanks!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I stared at <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s face as she happily went to open the lid.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"What is it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"No, it's nothing!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You're a weird one."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> gave the Ultra Fizz Bomber's cap a sharp twist.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\追加分\ペットボトルふた生音.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\噴出音.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\超炭酸ボンバー噴射.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "550" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The liquid inside sprayed out hard, straight at <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s face.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Pbbaht!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Ahahahaha!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Cough! </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! You definitely shook it before you handed it over!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Who knows!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just as you would guess, I had in fact given it a little shake, out of mischief.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="6"> was</STYLE> sopping wet, clothes and hair both.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"What did you do that for!</STYLE> <STYLE ID="1">The fizz has gone out of it, after all that!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"That's what bothers you!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed the fizz going flat bothered her more than the mess on her clothes and hair.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"The fizz is the whole life of this thing!? Wasting that fizz is nothing short of </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="ぼうとく">blasphemy</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Honestly, why is there nobody who understands this!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>, going on and on, expounding the incomprehensible wonders of fizz with real heat.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I listened, putting in a yeah, yeah here and there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With her face and hair and clothes all still <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="ぬ">wet</STYLE>, the sight of her expounding the wonders of fizz with such heat was absurdly comical.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "44" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
―Having said her say and satisfied herself, perhaps, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> looked up at the sky.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"You know, I just remembered something from way back. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">When we were little, back when </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> didn't hate the cherry blossoms yet, we drank juice together at a hanami, didn't we?"</STYLE> [TN: hanami = cherry-blossom viewing]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Was that... how it was?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"That time too, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you knocked my juice over. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I bawled my eyes out, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> just stood there blank-faced, as if you didn't understand what had happened..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I don't remember that at all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Or rather, I'm sorry, to think I did something like that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hahaha! I'm not blaming you! It's just, it takes me back."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"My dad died a long time ago. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> probably doesn't remember, but it was while we still lived over here. An accident."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, that was what set it off, and we ended up moving right after the accident. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Megasawa was closer to Dad's family home than here, and there was a good hospital there for healing </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s mind. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you had no idea why, but because I was the one moving away... you bawled your eyes out before we left."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Was that how it was...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Sorry for not telling you until now. There were all sorts of reasons, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> told me not to say. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">She said unhappy things like that get told once we're grown up."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"No, thank you for telling me. Now there are no more secrets between us!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "WAIT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah... that's right..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had the feeling <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s face clouded over.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There must still be things she cannot say.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But that can wait until <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> wants to say it.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... We're friends forever, aren't we?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> suddenly turned to me with a serious look in her eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="3">Y-Yeah!</STYLE> <STYLE ID="3">Of course we are!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I answered with a laugh, but the other way about, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s face clouded further and she looked down.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "WAIT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Thank you... I'm glad </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> is my best friend... Because I can't live without </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, if telling me would make it easier, tell me any time. I don't know if I can be of any help, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, thank you..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I have a favor to ask!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s eyes were <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="た">brimming</STYLE> with tears.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I want... I want you to indulge a selfish wish of mine..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"What's wrong? Tell me anything."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Just today, just this one day... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Until tomorrow morning, I want you to stay with me, just the two of us."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　What on earth is the mat―"</STYLE><BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花覗き込み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Please!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　I'll tell you the reason tomorrow..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Asked like that, with such urgency...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There seemed to be no option of refusing.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"All right. Then let me just go back and get my phone and―"</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No! I want us where nobody can reach us...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
