{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> said that and looked down.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I see... Then tell me tomorrow."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah... thank you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
