{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組みアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
With that, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> threw her arms tight around me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\春花なつみに抱き着く.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"We'll always... be together..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> brought her mouth to my ear and whispered softly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE>'s body was pressed tight against mine, and her heartbeat came through.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Somehow, that heartbeat felt oddly fast.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"But where should we go from here? We don't have enough money to stay at an inn."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
