{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s place, let's get her to put us up!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"But </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you said just the two of us..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">That one</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> can be trusted. I'll tell you the details tomorrow."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
