{MESON "500"}
And then <STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE> got briskly to her feet.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Sorry, but I can't go back to the house. We'll walk to </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s cram school."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">Goto</STYLE>'s cram school is quite a way off, but what bothers me is the reason she cannot go home, even at that cost.
{PAUSE ""}
